3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,700
Uncle Jiu, don’t listen to the wind, it’s the rain.

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,600
A nugget of gold has been passed down from my family for eight generations.

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,000
Recently I plan to start a company

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,200
