20
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,100
Uncle Jiu, please talk slowly

21
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,600
I'm tired. Let's go to bed first.

22
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,360
What hit?

23
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:43,690
If you have a few bad money, you won’t know how high the sky is. It’s true.

24
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,790
The channel does not disappear

25
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:45,890
As long as I come back here

26
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:48,790
She will appear simultaneously and Wang will come down.

27
